WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.925 --> 00:00:13.134
Daoist had vanished!

2
00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:17.617
Wukong ran outside and shot into the air.

3
00:00:21.361 --> 00:00:22.702
He looked in every direction.

4
00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:25.084
"Where did the Daoist go?"

5
00:00:25.384 --> 00:00:26.065
asked the monkey.

6
00:00:27.186 --> 00:00:29.768
Then he heard a shout from inside the palace.

7
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.220
"There are two Tang Monks!"

8
00:00:32.601 --> 00:00:33.341
cried Bajie.

9
00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:39.643
flew back inside.

10
00:00:43.004 --> 00:00:45.664
Two Tang Monks stood side by side.

11
00:00:47.065 --> 00:00:49.365
can't tell them apart," said Wujing.

12
00:00:49.385 --> 00:00:51.426
"They look exactly alike."

13
00:00:52.326 --> 00:00:54.507
"Which one of you is the real Tang Monk?"

14
00:00:54.867 --> 00:00:55.647
asked Wukong.

15
00:00:55.667 --> 00:00:57.288
"I am!"

16
00:00:57.588 --> 00:00:58.704
said one.

17
00:00:58.724 --> 00:01:00.645
The other monk glared at the first one.

18
00:01:00.665 --> 00:01:01.905
"No, I am!"

19
00:01:02.965 --> 00:01:04.746
The first monk looked at Wukong.

20
00:01:05.766 --> 00:01:06.886
believe him, Wukong.

21
00:01:07.366 --> 00:01:08.607
I am the real Tang Monk."

22
00:01:09.947 --> 00:01:11.648
believe said the other monk.

23
00:01:12.888 --> 00:01:13.928
am the real Tang Monk."

24
00:01:15.849 --> 00:01:18.449
Angry, Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

25
00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:22.951
"Which one of you is the real Tang Monk?"

26
00:01:23.911 --> 00:01:27.192
Both Tang Monks fell to their knees, shaking with fear.

27
00:01:28.076 --> 00:01:28.956
"Don't hit me!"

28
00:01:29.196 --> 00:01:30.017
they both cried.

29
00:01:32.257 --> 00:01:33.117
monkey sighed.

30
00:01:33.898 --> 00:01:35.738
He turned to Bajie and Wujing.

31
00:01:35.758 --> 00:01:36.858
"What can we do?"

32
00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:43.040
have an idea," said Bajie, smiling.

33
00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:44.741
"But you won't like it."

34
00:01:45.861 --> 00:01:46.281
"What is it?"

35
00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:47.361
asked Wukong.

36
00:01:50.582 --> 00:01:54.503
"The two Tang Monks should recite the Tight Headband spell," said the pig.

37
00:01:55.464 --> 00:01:59.622
"Only the Tang Monk, Guanyin, and Buddha know the spell.

38
00:02:00.703 --> 00:02:03.305
We'll know right away which Tang Monk is fake."

39
00:02:04.406 --> 00:02:06.688
"You just want to see me in pain!"

40
00:02:07.008 --> 00:02:07.788
said Wukong.

41
00:02:08.989 --> 00:02:09.890
Then he sighed.

42
00:02:09.910 --> 00:02:12.512
"But it is a good idea."

43
00:02:14.474 --> 00:02:16.935
Bajie and Wujing stood near the monks.

44
00:02:16.955 --> 00:02:22.640
"Master, recite the Tight Headband spell," said Wukong.

45
00:02:23.504 --> 00:02:27.207
Both monks began speaking, and Wukong fell to the floor.

46
00:02:27.227 --> 00:02:29.529
"It hurts!"

47
00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:30.450
he cried.

48
00:02:31.731 --> 00:02:33.973
Bajie watched the Tang Monks carefully.

49
00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:37.116
of them was reciting the spell.

50
00:02:38.317 --> 00:02:39.498
But the other one wasn't.

51
00:02:40.819 --> 00:02:42.321
"This is the fake Tang Monk!"

52
00:02:42.621 --> 00:02:44.022
shouted the pig, pointing.

53
00:02:44.042 --> 00:02:46.464
"He's just mumbling nonsense!"

54
00:02:48.226 --> 00:02:50.428
The real monk stopped reciting the spell.

55
00:02:51.616 --> 00:02:54.598
Bajie and Wujing tried to grab the fake monk.

56
00:02:55.419 --> 00:02:59.902
But the monk changed into a green lion and ran out of the throne room.

57
00:03:01.884 --> 00:03:02.724
"Get him!"

58
00:03:03.124 --> 00:03:03.985
shouted Wukong.

59
00:03:04.646 --> 00:03:06.747
He and his companions chased the lion.

60
00:03:08.328 --> 00:03:10.450
Outside, the lion leaped into the air.

61
00:03:12.151 --> 00:03:13.872
Wukong and the others shot after him.

62
00:03:15.053 --> 00:03:18.656
Clouds swirled, and soon they had the lion surrounded.

63
00:03:20.468 --> 00:03:24.351
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and raised it to strike.

64
00:03:25.432 --> 00:03:29.956
Just then a deep voice called out, "Do not hit him, Sun Wukong!"

65
00:03:31.397 --> 00:03:32.218
Everyone looked up.

66
00:03:32.238 --> 00:03:36.001
"It's the bodhisattva Manjusri!"

67
00:03:36.261 --> 00:03:37.002
said Wukong.

68
00:03:38.143 --> 00:03:41.065
"This green lion is my pet," said the bodhisattva.

69
00:03:41.085 --> 00:03:45.909
"The king of the Black Rooster Kingdom was cruel to someone many years ago.

70
00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:49.392
my lion came to Earth to punish him.

71
00:03:50.548 --> 00:03:52.389
The king's punishment is over now."

72
00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.452
The bodhisattva and the lion disappeared above the clouds.

73
00:03:59.293 --> 00:04:03.035
That night the king of the Black Rooster Kingdom hosted a feast.

74
00:04:04.416 --> 00:04:06.517
the feast he turned to the Tang Monk.

75
00:04:06.537 --> 00:04:10.319
"Thank you for your help.

76
00:04:10.399 --> 00:04:13.441
I hope you will reach the Western Paradise very soon."

77
00:04:16.202 --> 00:04:19.104
Weeks passed, and the travelers continued west.

78
00:04:21.401 --> 00:04:25.943
One day Wukong saw a mysterious red cloud over the mountains ahead.

79
00:04:26.904 --> 00:04:28.585
"Stop walking," he said quietly.

80
00:04:28.605 --> 00:04:31.206
"What's wrong?"

81
00:04:31.506 --> 00:04:32.347
asked the Tang Monk.

82
00:04:34.308 --> 00:04:35.609
red cloud disappeared.

83
00:04:36.129 --> 00:04:37.209
Wukong shook his head.

84
00:04:39.371 --> 00:04:40.051
"Nothing, Master.

85
00:04:40.651 --> 00:04:41.952
I thought I saw a red cloud."

86
00:04:43.973 --> 00:04:44.754
walked some more.

87
00:04:46.935 --> 00:04:50.056
Wukong saw the red cloud again.

88
00:04:50.116 --> 00:04:52.158
He held up his hand for the others to stop.

89
00:04:53.359 --> 00:04:57.503
The red cloud disappeared once again, and Wukong started to walk again.

90
00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:00.807
But then the red cloud reappeared.

91
00:05:00.827 --> 00:05:03.149
"Stop," said the monkey.

92
00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.451
Tang Monk groaned.

93
00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:08.414
"Wukong, should we keep going or
